.TH FL-WELCOME 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.4" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-welcome \- the first-login tour
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-welcome\fR [\fB\-\-first\-run\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A few pages that set up the desktop: light or dark and the accent colour, a
wallpaper, the panel at the top or the bottom, the keyboard layout (guessed
from the language), and Flathub for more applications. Each choice is saved
at once in the same files as \fBfl-settings\fR(1) uses.
.PP
It starts at the first login (\fI/etc/xdg/autostart/fl-welcome.desktop\fR
runs \fBfl-welcome \-\-first\-run\fR, which does nothing once
\fI~/.config/fldesktop/welcome-done\fR exists).
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-settings\fR(1)
